<section class="form-card data-transfer" data-controller="import" data-import-upload-url-value="{{ path('app_import_upload') }}" data-import-replay-token-value="{{ csrf_token('import-replay') }}">
    <p class="eyebrow">Données</p><h2>Importer ou sauvegarder</h2><p>Importez un export Yamtrack CSV. ZunaTrack ne remplace jamais vos données existantes.</p>
    <div class="form-actions"><button class="button button--primary" type="button" data-action="import#open">Importer Yamtrack</button><a class="button" href="{{ path('app_export_zunatrack') }}">Exporter ZunaTrack</a></div>
    <dialog class="import-dialog" data-import-target="dialog" data-action="click->import#backdrop"><form method="dialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="Fermer" type="submit">×</button></form><form data-import-target="form" data-action="submit->import#upload"><h2>Importer vos séries</h2><p>Sélectionnez votre export Yamtrack au format CSV. Les séries ambiguës seront mises de côté.</p><label class="form-field">Fichier CSV <input name="file" type="file" accept=".csv,text/csv" required data-import-target="file"></label><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('import-upload') }}"><button class="button button--primary" type="submit">Lancer l’import</button></form><p role="status" data-import-target="status"></p><a class="button" hidden data-import-target="remainder">Télécharger les séries restantes</a><ol class="import-live-list" data-import-target="items"></ol></dialog>
    {% if importBatches %}<ul class="import-history">{% for batch in importBatches %}<li><span>Import {{ batch.createdAt|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}</span><b>{{ batch.processed }}/{{ batch.total }}</b><small>{{ batch.imported }} importée{{ batch.imported > 1 ? 's' }} · {{ batch.merged }} fusionnée{{ batch.merged > 1 ? 's' }} · {{ batch.unresolved }} à valider</small></li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
</section>
